WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:30.462
Peter and Benjamin looked for the missing nuts.

2
00:00:30.463 --> 00:00:41.773
Timmy gathered new ones.

3
00:00:41.774 --> 00:00:45.483
"The squirrels are very busy," Peter said.

4
00:00:45.484 --> 00:00:48.319
"They are gathering lots of nuts."

5
00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:51.799
"Winter is coming," Benjamin said.

6
00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:52.482
"They need—"

7
00:00:52.483 --> 00:00:56.755
"Hey!" A squirrel suddenly shouted.

8
00:00:56.756 --> 00:01:00.665
"Look at my pile!" a second squirrel cried.

9
00:01:00.666 --> 00:01:06.818
"Who stole my nuts?" a third squirrel yelled.

10
00:01:06.819 --> 00:01:10.173
More squirrels came running.

11
00:01:10.174 --> 00:01:13.028
One squirrel shouted at Timmy Tiptoes.

12
00:01:13.029 --> 00:01:17.035
"Did you steal our nuts?" she cried.

13
00:01:17.036 --> 00:01:19.440
"No!" Timmy said.

14
00:01:19.441 --> 00:01:22.885
"Someone took some of my nuts too.

15
00:01:22.886 --> 00:01:26.346
There is a nut thief!"

16
00:01:26.347 --> 00:01:33.480
The squirrels shouted back and forth.

17
00:01:33.481 --> 00:01:39.433
Just then Peter spotted a fat squirrel.

18
00:01:39.434 --> 00:01:42.488
"Look, Benjamin!" Peter whispered.

19
00:01:42.489 --> 00:01:44.959
"It's Silvertail."

20
00:01:44.960 --> 00:01:49.380
Silvertail slipped over to the nut piles.

21
00:01:49.385 --> 00:01:52.211
The squirrels were still fighting.

22
00:01:52.212 --> 00:01:55.881
They did not see Silvertail.

23
00:01:55.882 --> 00:02:17.503
He took nuts from a pile!

24
00:02:17.504 --> 00:02:23.049
Silvertail hid the nuts under a log.

25
00:02:23.050 --> 00:02:27.051
Then he laughed.

26
00:02:27.052 --> 00:02:29.981
"I have lots of nuts for winter.

27
00:02:29.982 --> 00:02:42.669
I don't have to work at all!"

